125 million restructuring plan are all being reinvested back into the business and that's really important for us that we do that, continue to drive growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/18/intercontinental-hotels-group-ihg-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"IHG 2020 Q1","e":"ihg","d":"2020-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Keith Barr","x":"Furthermore, we've given our owners an opportunity to pause all renovation work and offering fee relief options passing through all cost reductions we are achieving on their behalf and providing increased payment flexibility, so they can reduce their cash pressures and manage through this time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q1-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"IHG 2020 Q1","e":"ihg","d":"2020-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Edgecliffe-Johnson","x":"We're doing, as I say everything we can on these either pass-through costs or system-funded costs to reduce their costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q1-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"IHG 2020 Q1","e":"ihg","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Edgecliffe-Johnson","x":"This sensitivity is before the cost savings, which we have announced.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q1-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"IHG 2020 Q1","e":"ihg","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Edgecliffe-Johnson","x":"To summarize, the cost reduction, cash flow and liquidity measures that we are taking will enable us to meet the immediate challenges facing the business, combined with our weighting to more resilient domestic mainstream travel demand, this positions us well to emerge stronger and deliver on our…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q1-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"IHG 2020 Q2","e":"ihg","d":"2020-08-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Keith Barr","x":"We have offered fee relief options, pass through all cost reductions we've achieved on their behalf with suppliers, temporarily relaxed brand standards and offer advice on how to flex operations in order to reduce costs and stay open.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q2-2020-earn/"},{"c":"IHG 2020 Q2","e":"ihg","d":"2020-08-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Edgecliffe-Johnson","x":"And that's' went from reducing some of the things they had to do in the hotels and we could scale back the costs of what was effectively passed through to them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q2-2020-earn/"},{"c":"IHG 2020 Q2","e":"ihg","d":"2020-08-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Keith Barr","x":"One of the measures we've taken to protect the business this year is to make up to a $150 million of cost reduction in the fee business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q2-2020-earn/"},{"c":"IHG 2020 Q2","e":"ihg","d":"2020-08-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Keith Barr","x":"We now plan to make around half of this cost savings sustainable into 2021, which includes a rebalancing of our resources to meet expected demand, while still allowing us to focus on investing in our business and growth initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q2-2020-earn/"},{"c":"IHG 2020 Q3","e":"ihg","d":"2020-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Edgecliffe-Johnson","x":"We remain on track to achieve our target of $150 million of fee business cost savings this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/23/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q3-2020-earn/"},{"c":"IHG 2020 Q3","e":"ihg","d":"2020-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Edgecliffe-Johnson","x":"In terms of the cost savings, well, I guess there's a few things to point out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/23/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q3-2020-earn/"},{"c":"IHG 2020 Q4","e":"ihg","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Edgecliffe-Johnson","x":"During the year, we achieved our target of $150 million of fee business cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q4-2020-earn/"},{"c":"IHG 2020 Q4","e":"ihg","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Edgecliffe-Johnson","x":"As such, we are targeting around $75 million of fee business cost savings being sustainable in 2021 and beyond.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q4-2020-earn/"},{"c":"IHG 2021 Q2","e":"ihg","d":"2021-08-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Edgecliffe-Johnson","x":"We know the demand is there and I think we all studied in our basic economics that when demand is greater than supply, then you see a lot of pricing power for hotel owners.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/10/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q2-2021-earn/"},{"c":"IHG 2021 Q2","e":"ihg","d":"2021-08-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Edgecliffe-Johnson","x":"In central operations and overheads, the net operating loss reduced to $40 million driven by the $8 million benefit from the System Fund reporting change and the cost saving program we implemented last year, which remains on track to deliver a sustainable $75 million reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/10/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q2-2021-earn/"},{"c":"IHG 2021 Q2","e":"ihg","d":"2021-08-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Edgecliffe-Johnson","x":"As a reminder, our RevPAR sensitivity is referring in 2021 versus 2019 and is calculated before cost savings with the majority of $75 million having being delivered in the first half.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/10/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q2-2021-earn/"},{"c":"IHG 2021 Q3","e":"ihg","d":"2021-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Vicki Stern","x":"…in terms of price and given your comments there on the sort of rate indications, business guys wanting to lock in sort of decent rates at this stage, just how sustainable you think that positive pricing dynamic is as we look into next year perhaps with a more normal business leisure mix. Thanks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/22/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"IHG 2021 Q3","e":"ihg","d":"2021-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Edgecliffe-Johnson","x":"As a reminder, our RevPAR sensitivity is referring to 2021 versus 2019 and is calculated before cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/22/intercontinental-hotels-group-plc-ihg-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"IHG 2026 Q2","e":"ihg","d":"2026-08-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Leo Carrington","x":"Is it pricing power?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/18/ihg-ihg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IHG 2026 Q2","e":"ihg","d":"2026-08-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Elie Maalouf","x":"So on AI hotel cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/18/ihg-ihg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[40,1,12464,0,0,0,10194,1899],[41,1,9628,0,0,0,7977,1309],[42,1,13174,0,0,0,11120,1675],[43,1,8317,0,0,0,6130,1783],[44,1,14601,0,0,0,12674,1556],[45,1,7681,0,0,0,5720,1589],[46,1,11874,0,0,0,9845,1684],[47,1,4996,0,0,0,3907,856],[66,1,15254,0,0,0,13385,1600]],"cinema":[[40,1,12464,0,0,0,10194,1